{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The grue daemon: each dark turn ticks the counter. The warning prints on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first dark turn; dark turns 2…"},{"code":"graceTurns + 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are a silent grace;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from dark turn "},{"code":"graceTurns + 2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on, each turn rolls "},{"code":"chance(lethality)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be eaten. Stepping back into the light — or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended"},{"type":"text","text":" — resets the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"count. Guards before the draw, so a lit turn burns no randomness."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/timers","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"GnustoDangerousDark"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timers","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:19GnustoDangerousDark0bC0V6timersSay0A010TimedEventVGvp","title":"timers"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/timers"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timers","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent"},{"text":"] { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The warning goes out through "},{"code":"sayOnceThisTurn(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which changes what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is printed and nothing else: a warning swallowed for repeating the room’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own dark line is still a warned turn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The death is always the lingering one, and the line has to say so."}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The counter cannot reach the dice before the third dark turn, so nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this daemon kills was killed on the turn it walked into the dark — which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is the distinction Zork draws with two separate sentences. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"V-WALK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"gverbs.zil:1578","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") says “You have walked into the slavering fangs of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lurking grue!” and fires only on a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"blocked","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" move in the dark, a mechanic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this plugin does not have at all; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GOTO"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gverbs.zil:2110-2114"},{"type":"text","text":") says"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“A lurking grue slithered into “ and then the vehicle’s name, or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"word “room”, “and devoured you!” — and is the one that fits. Both games"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here had been handed the first. (#350)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That branch is why "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text\/death","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" takes a subject: the vehicle the player was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"aboard, or nothing. Both halves are the game’s own words. A library that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has never seen the game has no business deciding what to call the place"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"somebody was taken from, so the stock line names none."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/timers":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/timers","role":"symbol","title":"timers","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/timers","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The grue daemon: each dark turn ticks the counter. The warning prints on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first dark turn; dark turns 2…"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 1"},{"type":"text","text":" are a silent grace;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from dark turn "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 2"},{"type":"text","text":" on, each turn rolls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chance(lethality)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be eaten. Stepping back into the light — or "},{"type":